EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

I want to congratulate you on receiving the ASU Solutions Grant, which is an additional <<INSERT AMOUNT>> for your first year at ASU! You can view and accept this award in My ASU under the Finances tab at http://my.asu.edu/.

Remember to keep checking your Priority Tasks in My ASU (http://my.asu.edu/) for any items you need to complete before enrolling.

If you haven't done so already, your next step to becoming a Sun Devil is to pay your enrollment deposit (https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit) in My ASU at http://my.asu.edu/. Once you submit your enrollment deposit, you will be able to complete your next steps, such as signing up for housing and for orientation, where you will register for classes.

If you have any questions about enrolling at ASU or this grant, you can contact me. I am happy to answer any questions you may have.

We look forward to seeing you at ASU.

Go Devils!

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
